// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Aaron Thiery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P944566542" "Aaron Thiery"
// ProfessionString :
"P2685553112" "SERAPH Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
"P2861617379" "Aaron Thiery is one of the top scientists for SERAPH. He has worked his way up as a lowly lab assistant to one of the premier scientists in the organization.<br><br>Some members of SERAPH question some of Thiery's methods, and he tends to be somewhat anti-social, but he always seems to get the job done. It's unknown why exactly he has been sent out to deal with the situation in Argosy."
// LocationString :
"P2752802251" "Atlas Park"
// HelloString :
"P3399308232" "There is much to do, {HeroName}. We must continue our progress."
// HelloString :
"P3113850797" "The city will not save itself. It will be done by the likes of you and I."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1492543466" "I'm afraid you and I are not yet ready to talk to each other, {HeroName}. There is still much both of us need to do."
// FirstVisitString :
"P396742767" "Hello, {HeroName}. I am Aaron Thiery, a scientist in the illustrious group known as SERAPH.<br><br>Habashy has informed me of your work to push back the chaos in Atlas. I have some information that may prove particularly useful for you.<br><br>As this is going to be something that is more important than my previous experiments, I have left my labs to work with you 'in the field', as they say.<br><br>Shall we get to work?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1773369645" "It looks like you have too much on your plate at the moment, {HeroName}. Come back and see me when you're not so busy."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2472804946" "How is it that you can see my FailsafeLevelString?  That should be impossible, unless we've raised the level cap or you're peeking through .pigg files."
// IntroString :
"P2644350041" "There's a scientist that works at SERAPH, his name is Aaron Thiery. Matthew Habashy said he might be able to help regarding the situation with Arachnos in Atlas Park. He'd like for you to go talk to him to see what you can find."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3297660025" "Meet with Aaron Thiery"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P430854260" "SERAPH is always trying to help out with things here in Atlas. I know you can help them out, {HeroName}! Just watch out for Thiery, I've heard he's a little... weird."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ThieryDead Text :
"P136365750" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Aaron Thiery at this time.</color>"
// Page ThierySaved Text :
"P2467244437" "There's currently nothing more we can do together, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


