// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Matthew Habashy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P469111239" "Matthew Habashy"
// ProfessionString :
"P1974235132" "FBSA Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P3199829728" "Matthew Habashy is an agent of the Federal Bureau of Super-powered Affairs.<br><br>Before the destruction of Galaxy City, he was just another desk worker in Atlas Park who may have been on track towards a promotion. However, when the disaster hit, the FBSA needed someone to step up, and Habashy was one of the few people who they felt could handle the job."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P237865231" "We've got a lot of work ahead of us, {HeroName}"
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P3400833906" "There's a lot to be done before Atlas Park is returned back to normal, {HeroName}. Let's get to work."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2427264330" "One of the people who need your help is a man named <color yellow>Officer Fields,</color> a rookie cop who was part of the Galaxy City PD, and other is a woman named <color yellow>Sondra Costel</color>.<br><br>You'll only have time to help one of them, but don't worry. There's another hero who was inspired by your actions with the Hellions who is going to help whoever you can't get to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Captured Text :
"P245265063" "<color orange>Matthew Habashy's phone rings for a few moments before he picks it up.</color><br><br>{HeroName}! I'm in the Arachnos base now, they're on to me! Look, you've got to make your move, <i>now</i>!<br><br>They're distracted from the front door, and - <br><br><color orange>Matthew's phone cuts out.</color>"
// Page Normal Text :
"P870361468" "Both of our jobs are never done, {HeroName}. Maybe when we both have a break, we can sit back and talk about things."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Normal Text :
"P1237318163" "Sorry, {HeroName}, I can't ask you to help me out more when you're already helping out so many other people."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


