// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Officer Fields 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1091685858" "Officer Fields"
// ProfessionString :
"P1887519038" "PPD Officer"
// DescriptionString :
"P747250768" "Officer Fields was a recruit fresh out of the academy when the meteors hit Galaxy City. He performed bravely during the incident and was assigned to patrol the area of the Promenade right after the incident. Officer Fields is eager to prove himself to everyone in the PPD, though he'll need the help of a hero if he's going to handle what comes up in Paragon City."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1399611643" "Let's get to the bottom of this, {HeroName}!"
// HelloString :
"P3494773122" "Nothing can get much worse after Galaxy. Right?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1187385571" "{HeroName}, I'd love to have your help right now, but I'm mainly just handing out parking tickets. Maybe soon I'll come across something big, huh?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4154138770" "We're all set here, {HeroName}! You need to go and handle things in the rest of the city!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1224904671" "You've got way too many things right now, {HeroName}. I'll handle what I can until you're free."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1027613119" "Officer Fields is a rookie cop who barely made it out of the Galaxy incident. He's working a beat over in the Promenade. He's sent word that the PPD there need some help on a murder case, one that could quickly turn into a series of murders if it isn't stopped."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3646995279" "Help Officer Fields"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4082922404" "Officer Fields is new to this whole thing, but hey, so am I, and we did a good job together, right?<br><br>I'll let you know when I've found out more information about Arachnos activity here in Atlas."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MetFields Text :
"P2574796728" "Hey, {HeroName}. Remember me? ... I kind of hope you don't, since when we last met, I was trying not to lose my lunch.<br><br>I'm glad you're here, though. We've got nothing but trouble over here in the Promenade. This place was once known for its theaters and music halls, but many of them have closed over the past few years due to the high rates of crime.<br><br>Things aren't getting any better with what <i>just</i>happened, too."
// Answer Text :
"P3711865331" "What happened?"
// Page DidntMeetFields Text :
"P2759889863" "Hi, you're {HeroName}, right? Matthew Habashy told me all about you, how much you helped with the Hellions in Atlas Plaza and Prometheus Park.<br><br>I'm glad you're here, we've got nothing but trouble over here in the Promenade. This place was once known for its theaters and music halls, but many of them have closed over the past few years due to the high rates of crime.<br><br>Things aren't getting any better with what <i>just</i> happened."
// Answer Text :
"P3495107274" "What's going on?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


