// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Sondra Costel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3534184619" "Sondra Costel"
// ProfessionString :
"P3208909962" "Cygnus Medical Center Doctor"
// DescriptionString :
"P1965819955" "Sondra Costel was a doctor at the Cygnus Medical Center. She survived the Galaxy Incident through sheer luck and is now trying to help the people in her home neighborhood of Hyperion Way."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1552920273" "We've got a long way to go before Hyperion Way is saved."
// HelloString :
"P987320111" "Let's see what we can do for the people here, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2658285679" "Oh, don't let me take up any of your time, {HeroName}!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3809634787" "We've done all we can for Hyperion Way, {HeroName}. Thank you <i>so</i> much for all your help!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1719938790" "Oh, don't let me bother you with anything, {HeroName}, you have <i>way</i> too much to do!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1986437200" "Sondra Costel is a doctor who worked for the hospital in Galaxy City. She's trying to help the people in <color yellow>Hyperion Way</color>, but there's a force working against her. She could use your help, {HeroName}."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3190709606" "Help Sondra Costel"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4278336499" "Sondra Costel is doing her best in a bad situation. I'm sure you can help her change things in Hyperion Way.<br><br>When I get more information about Arachnos, I'll let you know."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P958843299" "I think you might want to look into what Matthew Habashy found out as soon as you can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ChoseOfficerFields Text :
"P3140355390" "Hi, {HeroName}! Don't worry about me, that hero from the FBSA is here to help out.<br><br>You should focus on other things right now, we'll handle things on our end!"
// Answer Text :
"P3951164122" "Alright, good luck, Sondra."
// Page MetSondra Text :
"P2342580982" "Hi! {HeroName}, I remember you! We spoke to each other back in Galaxy City.<br><br>I'm happy that you made it out of there too. I count my blessings every minute, knowing that I survived that ordeal.<br><br>And also that you're here, too! I've been trying my best to help people in Hyperion Way... but something is just... <i>wrong</i> here."
// Answer Text :
// Page DidntMeetSondra Text :
"P986252834" "Hi, you're {HeroName}, right? Matthew Habashy told me that you'd be here to help out! My name's <color yellow>Sondra Costel</color>, I'm one of the survivors of Galaxy City.<br><br>I was a doctor in the hospital back then, but now... I'm doing my best to try to bring the people of Hyperion Way back together. It isn't easy, though.<br><br>There's a lot of... resistance, here. Something bad is happening, {HeroName}. Someone's trying to turn the people against each other!"
// Page StartMissions Text :
"P1011975665" "We have a lot of refugees from Galaxy being housed here. The government has been sending food supplies for them, but someone has been <i>stealing</i> said supplies, leaving the people angry and restless!<br><br>What's worse is that they're not angry at the thieves, they're angry at the people trying to <i>help</i> them, saying that they should be doing more to protect the refugees!<br><br>The people in Hyperion Way need to believe that there <i>are</i> people out there who <i>can</i> help them, {HeroName}. I think you and I can do just that!"
// Answer Text :
"P2795953901" "Let's get started, then."
// Page DontHaveButMet Text :
"P1209243880" "Hi! {HeroName}, I remember you! We spoke to each other back in Galaxy City.<br><br>I'm happy that you made it out of there too. I count my blessings every minute, knowing that I survived that ordeal.<br><br>Let's chat again soon, when both of us have some more time, okay?"
// Answer Text :
"P1139723102" "Sounds good."
// Page DontHaveDidntMeet Text :
"P3730935376" "Oh, wow! You're one of those <color yellow>heroes</color>, aren't you? I'm really honored to meet you, my name's <color yellow>Sondra Costel</color>.<br><br>I won't bother you though, I'm sure you have plenty of things to worry about it. Good luck!"
// Answer Text :
"P2545869127" "Thanks, you too."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

